{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"三年春正月，公會齊侯于嬴。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"夏，齊侯、衛侯胥命于蒲。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"六月，公會杞侯于郕。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"秋七月壬辰朔，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"公子翬如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"九月，齊侯送姜氏于讙。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"公會齊侯於讙。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"夫人姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"冬，齊侯使其弟年來聘。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"有年。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"三年春，曲沃武公伐翼，次于陘庭，韓萬御戎，梁弘為右，逐翼侯于汾隰，驂絓而止。夜獲之，及欒共叔。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"會于嬴，成昬于齊也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"夏，齊侯、衛侯胥命于蒲，不盟也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"公會杞侯于郕，杞求成也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"秋，公子翬如齊逆女。修先君之好。故曰「公子」。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"齊侯送姜氏于讙，非禮也。凡公女嫁于敵國，姊妹，則上卿送之，以禮於先君；公子，則下卿送之。於大國，雖公子，亦上卿送之。於天子，則諸卿皆行，公不自送。於小國，則上大夫送之。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"冬，齊仲年來聘，致夫人也。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_14_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_14","textTraditional":"芮伯萬之母芮姜惡芮伯之多寵人也，故逐之，出居于魏。","sentenceOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}